<title>USA: Cortand, N.Y. won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Cortand, N.Y. won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc. said it won $2.5 million of Cortland, N.Y., public improvement (Serial) bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
</text>
